### Case: inbound-decrypted — the inbound direction, correct wire format.
### The body is base64 of an armored PGP message encrypted to the gateway's key.
### Expect 200, and the backend to receive the PLAINTEXT with content-type
### application/json — the plugin sets that on the upstream call.
POST {{GATEWAY}}/statements/inbound
content-type: text/plain

{{BASE64_OF_ARMORED_PGP_MESSAGE}}
